        "provider_contract": "deepseek-native",
        "tool_type_family": "web_search_*"
      },
      "status": "supported",
      "action": "none",
      "reason": "DeepSeek's native Anthropic contract supports provider-side Web Search. CSSwitch preserves the typed declaration and its server_tool_use/web_search_tool_result history without treating it as a DSML client function.",
